{"id":"f0c7d6fbe9cca58a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-ktrivial-cost.md","title":"K 平凡性的标准尾和代价","display":"df-ktrivial-cost — K 平凡性的标准尾和代价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-ktrivial-cost","aliases":["43-df-ktrivial-cost"],"display":"df-ktrivial-cost — K 平凡性的标准尾和代价","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§15.5.3, printed p.450 / PDF p.470; Thm.15.1.28","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-ktrivial-cost"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-ktrivial-cost</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ktrivial-cost — K 平凡性的标准尾和代价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a859725f17832d5\" href=\"?note=1a859725f17832d5\" title=\"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable\">43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§15.5.3, printed p.450 / PDF p.470; Thm.15.1.28"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,x,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n)\">\\(K(n)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的固定最优机器与自然数编码。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(k:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(k)\\land\\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;k(n,s+1)\\le k(n,s)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}k(n,s)=K(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(k)\\land\\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;k(n,s+1)\\le k(n,s)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}k(n,s)=K(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；这种有限值上逼近的存在性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a859725f17832d5\" href=\"?note=1a859725f17832d5\" title=\"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable\">43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_s(n)\\coloneqq k(n,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_s(n)\\coloneqq k(n,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_K(x,s)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\x&lt;n\\le s}}2^{-K_s(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_K(x,s)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\x&lt;n\\le s}}2^{-K_s(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>尾和从x之后开始，因为位置x变化恰好影响长度大于x的初段。这里固定一种有限值阶段表示：从可计算的描述长度上界开始递减，可避免把无穷作为机器输出。固定k后，c_K是唯一确定的有理值函数；Kraft界给出其极限条件。来源定位沿用附件，此次未重新核对原书PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable","status":"resolved","id":"1a859725f17832d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,x,s\\in\\mathbb N$；$K(n)$ 采用 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的固定最优机器与自然数编码。固定 $k:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$，满足","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]；这种有限值上逼近的存在性见 [[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable","status":"resolved","id":"1a859725f17832d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]；这种有限值上逼近的存在性见 [[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,x,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K(n)","display":false},{"tex":"k:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(k)\\land\\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;k(n,s+1)\\le k(n,s)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}k(n,s)=K(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"K_s(n)\\coloneqq k(n,s).","display":true},{"tex":"c_K(x,s)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\x<n\\le s}}2^{-K_s(n)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1651,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial-cost]] — K 平凡性的标准尾和代价"},{"id":"2802ffac8a9caa38","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$c_K$ 与 $\\mathrm{ObeysCost}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-cost]]、[[43-df-obeys-cost]]；K 平凡性见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]。"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848","f357216a7edb035a","1a859725f17832d5"]}